<title>PORTUGAL: RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS PORTUGUESE RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS PORTUGUESE RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>FIGUEIRA DA FOZ, Portugal 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reigning world champion Tommi Makinen of Finland, driving a Mitsubishi, won the Portuguese Rally on Wednesday when he finished four minutes and five seconds clear of second placed Belgian Freddy Loix in his Toyota.</p>
<p>Germany's Armin Schwarz finished third in his Ford.</p>
</text>
